#: sdlc/processes/docs-site-publish.bpmn:67
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Regenerates every derived reference from its source, so the site is never built from committed copies that may be stale: the derived artefacts kept off the commit (`bun run cat derive:publish`), the skill schema and instruction pages (`gen-schema-docs.ts`, `gen-skill-docs.ts`), the content-backed docs pages (`gen-docs-pages.ts`), the graph projections and viewers (`schema:viz`, `library:viz`, `uploads:viz`, `voices:viz` and others), the handler and translation indexes (`handler:index`, `translation:index`), and the BPMN drawings and process pages (`render:bpmn`, `processes:viz`). After a main deploy, `writer-records` reruns every writer and QA step under strace to record its reads, so a preview reruns only those whose reads changed; the main deploy runs everything."
msgstr ""

